      "cooked": "<p>An upcoming NASA mission’s principal investigator is launching a card game on Kickstarter to fund the mission’s outreach budget.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/66d1ac1af0bdc0ec703f6d4e1a1e8e8315cf590d.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"192\" height=\"192\">\n      <a href=\"https://spacenews.com/osiris-rex-to-kickstart-outreach-budget-with-card-game/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" title=\"01:19PM - 09 September 2015\">SpaceNews – 9 Sep 15</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/491;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ac35ff769c576c48dcc95f676f5928028ef4e8fa_2_690x491.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"491\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ac35ff769c576c48dcc95f676f5928028ef4e8fa_2_690x491.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/ac35ff769c576c48dcc95f676f5928028ef4e8fa.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/ac35ff769c576c48dcc95f676f5928028ef4e8fa.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/ac35ff769c576c48dcc95f676f5928028ef4e8fa_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://spacenews.com/osiris-rex-to-kickstart-outreach-budget-with-card-game/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Osiris-Rex to Kickstart Outreach Budget With Card Game</a></h3>\n\n<p>The head of NASA’s Osiris-Rex asteroid sample-return probe plans to crowdfund an outreach budget for the mission on Kickstarter by selling a card game.</p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"label1\">Est. reading time: 2 minutes</span>\n    </p>\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>This is kind of a great idea, but man, oh man, are those actions depressingly realistic!</p>",
